@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+---
+id: task-003-conform-json-patch-application-to-rfc-6902
+type: task
+title: "Conform JSON Patch application to RFC 6902"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Reviewed `applyPatch` against RFC 6902's operation and error requirements. Root `remove` now fails
+instead of returning `null`, and a root-to-root `move` remains the valid no-op implied by remove then
+add semantics. `from` must be an own operation member.
+
+Added regression coverage for root behavior and ignored, operation-irrelevant members. Verified the
+library test suite and all 92 enabled cases in the JSON Patch conformance suite.
